OL,3,AChina tightens travel restrictions for
OL,4,Acitizens
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew rules governing travel to and from
OL,7,FChina have come into effect, a move
OL,8,Fthat observers say will further tighten
OL,9,Fthe government's control over its
OL,10,Fcitizens.
OL,12,FCitizens deemed to have "harmed"
OL,13,FChina's national security or interests
OL,14,Fwhile overseas can also be barred from
OL,15,Fleaving China for up to three years
OL,16,Fafter they return, while those who
OL,17,Fviolate technological import and export
OL,18,Fregulations may also be banned from
OL,19,Fleaving.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
