OL,3,AChina tightens travel restrictions for
OL,4,Acitizens
OL,5,
OL,6,FChinese authorities say the rules are
OL,7,Fto "safeguard national sovereignty and
OL,8,Fsecurity" and deny that they restrict
OL,9,Fthe travel of "ordinary citizens".
OL,11,FBut critics say the new rules could
OL,12,Ffurther boost Beijing's ability to
OL,13,Fexert pressure on its nationals'
OL,14,Factivities abroad.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
